  "Selects which CryptoAdapter backs server-side application crypto (DB column encryption, settings.json wrapping, audit-log signing, KEK custody). Wire-protocol HMAC, body SHA-256, and agent-side PBKDF2 stay on the in-process AWS-LC FIPS module regardless of this choice (always-local per the enterprise-compliance contract).": {
